{"parentUuid":"be032dba-1cb2-4db5-8044-556f4767f5a1","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"f51e2112-0260-44ed-9b89-c69d1eac8b4d","agentId":"a9840a94295146d85","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FGGxX6KaXtLghi4BvksQFf","type":"tool_result","content":"## rasterizegeo | Rasterize Geometry | Rasterizes geometry onto a layer.\n   in : camera_ref, geometry | out: output1\n   par: Quick Setups {Add Alpha/Add Position/Add Normal/Add UV/Add Depth from Eye}; Move to Origin; Depth Mode {Minimum/Maximum}; Face Culling {No Culling/Backface/Frontface}; Output Type; Name {rasterization}; Optional; Default Value; Border\n## posmap | Position Map | Generates a position map.\n   in : size_ref | out: pos\n   par: Signature; Source Position {Position/Camera Origin/View Direction}; X Border {Clamp/Mirror/Wrap/Extend}; X Shift; X Cycles; Y Border {Clamp/Mirror/Wrap/Extend}; Y Shift; Y Cycles; Z Border {Clamp/Mirror/Wrap/Extend}; Z Shift; Z Cycles\n## possample | Position Sample | Samples an input texture by position.\n   in : pos, texture | out: sample\n   par: Signature\n## triplanar | Triplanar | Generates a texture by projecting X, Y, and Z textures onto the position layer.\n   in : position, texture, x_texture, y_texture, z_texture | out: triplanar\n   par: Signature; Normal Type {Signed (-1 to 1)/Offset (0 to 1)}; Texture Source {Uniform Texture/Texture Per Axis}; Scale; Rotate; Offset; Scale; Rotation; Offset; Scale; Rotate; Offset; Scale; Rotate; Offset; Blend; X-Z Blending; Y Blend; Filter Scale; Filter\n## uvmap | UV Map | Generates a UV Map.\n   in : size_ref | out: uv, uvscale\n   par: UV Space {Texture/Image/Pixel}; U Border {Clamp/Mirror/Wrap/Extend}; U Shift; U Cycles; V Border {Clamp/Mirror/Wrap/Extend}; V Shift; V Cycles\n## sample | UV Sample | Samples an input layer using a UV layer or attribute.\n   in : uv, filterscale, texture | out: sample\n   par: Signature; UV Space {Texture/Image}; Filter Scale; Filter\n## layer | Layer | Generates