 the bakers (not graph nodes); and any Designer plugin or user library content.\n16\t- The documentation pages of some nodes (for example the grunge maps and the Clouds, Dirt and Directional noise variants) do not describe their visual character; their entries state this and avoid inventing it.\n17\t- Equivalences marked UNVERIFIED have not been tested in Houdini by me (no Houdini session was opened); they were built from the Houdini 22.0.368 local node help, which lists COP node names, inputs, outputs and parameter labels.\n18\t\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/zenray/.claude/Memory1","sessionId":"3a9c2407-7dcc-4acd-baf2-90a94300e953","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"main","slug":"deep-stirring-lark"}
