e uses a darker shade).\nuse: Documenting the stages of a height graph (base shapes, details, wear, outputs).\ncop: Network boxes of the Houdini network editor (SideFX lists Frame under Network box).\nstatus: sidefx\n\n## graph-comment\nname: Comment\nurl: https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/docs/substance-3d-designer/using/workspace/graph-view/graph-items/comment\ncat: Graph items\nrel: low\npurpose: Free-floating text placed anywhere in a graph to annotate and explain parts of it; its Description property holds the displayed text.\nuse: Notes on measured settings and reasons for a node setup.\ncop: Sticky notes of the Houdini network editor and node comments.\nstatus: unverified\n","numLines":33,"startLine":1,"totalLines":33}},"displayPath":"../../../../private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-zenray--claude-Memory1/3a9c2407-7dcc-4acd-baf2-90a94300e953/scratchpad/work/entries/14_graph_items.txt"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"176074e3-fc7a-497f-a04d-db3f2400ab7c","timestamp":"2026-10-11T15:12:11.270Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-zenray--claude-Memory1/3a9c2407-7dcc-4acd-baf2-90a94300e953/scratchpad/work/entries/14_graph_items.txt\"}\n</system-reminder>"},{"content":"<system-reminder>\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\t## graph-dot-portal\n2\tname: Dot node (also Portal)\n3\turl: https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/docs/substance-3d-designer/using/workspace/graph-view/graph-items/dot-node\n4\tcat: Graph items\n5\trel: low\n6\tpurpose: Routing helper that reroutes and groups connections; a transmitter Dot node named in the graph and receiver Dot nodes that pick its name form a portal that hides a long connection (portals were added in Designer 13.0, Dot nodes in 2019.2; portals are not supported inside FX-Map graphs).\n7\tnote: A graph item rather than a processing node; created with Alt on a link, Alt while dragging from a connector, or from the Node menu. Alt pl